title: "AI Traffic Congestion Detection and Adaptive Signal Control"
authors:
  - family-names: Mohurle
    given-names: Abhinav Nitin
version: 0.1.0
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Aaabhi0406/adaptive-traffic-signal-control"
abstract: >-
  Research prototype combining YOLOv8 vehicle detection, DeepSORT tracking,
  class-weighted traffic-demand estimation, Random Forest short-horizon
  forecasting, adaptive intersection control, and SUMO controller ablations.
  Experiments are exploratory and do not represent live-road deployment or
  an end-to-end real-world four-camera validation.
